SoundTriggerGtest is implemented in order to verify Samsung Voice Trigger System.
This tool can check some conditions of VTS driver, XML, Mixer and so on.

User's Guide:
1. Setup build environment and build SoundTriggerGtest using 'm SoundTriggerGtest' or 'mm' command.

2. The image file will be located in below path.
out/target/product/universal9925/data/nativetest/SoundTriggerGtest/

3. Push the image using adb command.
adb push SoundTriggerGtest /data/

4. Change permissions.
adb shell "chmod 777 /data/SoundTriggerTest"

5. Run the test program.
adb shell "./data/SoundTriggerGtest"

6. Check the result.

Ex)

